BT /F2 12 Tf 50 696 Td (1. Annual leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 678 Td (Full-time employees receive 27 days of paid annual leave per calendar year, in addition to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 664 Td (public holidays. Part-time employees receive leave pro rata to their contracted hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 646 Td (Up to 6 unused days may be carried over into the next year. Carried-over days must be used) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 632 Td (by 31 March of that year, after which they lapse without compensation.) Tj ET
